---
const physical = ['10', '20', 'NULL', '5', '7'];
const logical = ['20', '40', 'NULL', '10', '14'];
---
<figure class="field-recipe" aria-label="Source amounts 10, 20, null, 5 and 7 are doubled by the logical amount field; the metric sums them to 84">
  <div class="recipe-flow">
    <div class="recipe-column"><span class="recipe-label">Physical source</span><strong>Raw amount</strong><ol>{physical.map(value => <li class="qf-figure">{value}</li>)}</ol></div>
    <div class="recipe-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><span>× 2</span>→</div>
    <div class="recipe-column logical"><span class="recipe-label">Model field</span><strong>Logical amount</strong><ol>{logical.map(value => <li class="qf-figure">{value}</li>)}</ol></div>
    <div class="recipe-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><span>Sum</span>→</div>
    <div class="recipe-metric"><span class="recipe-label">Dataset metric</span><strong>Revenue</strong><span class="metric-value qf-figure">84</span><span>Uses the declared field</span></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The model separates physical storage from reporting meaning. The metric sums the logical amounts; NULL remains NULL and SUM ignores it.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .field-recipe { container-type: inline-size; margin: 2rem 0; }
  .recipe-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: .4rem; }
  .recipe-label { display: block; color: var(--color-sun-700); font-size: .65rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: .45rem; }
  .recipe-column > strong,.recipe-metric > strong { display: block; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .recipe-column { text-align: center; }
  .recipe-column ol { list-style: none !important; margin: 1rem 0 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; display: grid; gap: .35rem; }
  .recipe-column li { margin: 0 !important; padding: .3rem !important; background: var(--color-soil-100); border: 1px solid var(--color-soil-300); font-size: .85rem; }
  .logical li { border-color: #a5b090; background: #edf1e7; }
  .recipe-arrow { text-align: center; color: var(--color-field-700); font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .recipe-arrow span { display: block; font-size: .65rem; }
  .recipe-metric { text-align: center; padding: 1rem .3rem; border-block: 2px solid var(--color-field-700); }
  .metric-value { display: block; font-size: 2.7rem; color: var(--color-field-700); margin: .5rem 0; }
  .recipe-metric > span:last-child { display: block; font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-soil-700); }
  figcaption { margin-top: 1.3rem; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-soil-700); }
  @container(max-width:450px) { .recipe-flow { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 1.6rem minmax(0,1fr); } .recipe-flow > .recipe-arrow:nth-child(4) { grid-column: 1/-1; transform: rotate(90deg); height: 2rem; } .recipe-flow > .recipe-arrow:nth-child(4) span { display: none; } .recipe-metric { grid-column: 1/-1; } }
</style>
